;==========================================================
;セフレ契約用
;==========================================================
;"補正"でRETURNした数値が理性判定に加算されるので、
;簡単にセフレにしたいならマイナス、難易度を上げたかったり実質不可能にしたいならプラスすべし
@KOJO_SF_CONTRACT_K9(ARGS)
SELECTCASE ARGS
	CASE "導入"
		PRINTFORML 「Friends with benefits...?」
		PRINTFORML 「Eh? Hah? What? Did you eat something weird? Or have you just gone off the deep end?」
		PRINTFORMDW You assure her that you're both serious and mentally competent.
		PRINTFORML 「I mean, suggesting something like that out of the blue, of course I'm going to wonder if you've lost your marbles.」
	CASE "補正"
		PRINTFORML （...Or so I say... How should I respond?）
		;RETURN -1000
	CASE "成功"
		PRINTFORML （It does feel like we're pretty compatible in that way... Hmm～...）
		PRINTFORML （Nn～... Well, if it feels good, maybe that wouldn't too bad...? This kind of relationship is less complicated, too.）
		PRINTFORML 「Okay, I accept... Let's be sex friends.」
	CASE "失敗"
		PRINTFORML 「Sorry, but no. Go ask someone else for that kind of thing.」
ENDSELECT

